WEBVTT

00:03:57.415 --> 00:04:00.878
So what is this magical weapon
I call "trade"?

00:04:01.475 --> 00:04:02.762
It's simple:

00:04:03.461 --> 00:04:05.140
I have something you want,

00:04:05.557 --> 00:04:07.544
you have something I need.

00:04:08.561 --> 00:04:10.154
We make an exchange.

00:04:10.813 --> 00:04:12.583
But the question is:

00:04:12.973 --> 00:04:15.585
How can something so simple

00:04:15.609 --> 00:04:19.627
have such a dramatic impact
on poverty and security?

00:04:20.934 --> 00:04:22.414
Let's start with poverty.

00:04:23.045 --> 00:04:25.332
There's no better example than China.

00:04:25.858 --> 00:04:30.604
Before China adopted
economic reform 37 years ago,